## Product Overview
The Q & A Interop Bot is a conversational chat agent embedded in the existing partner portal (built on Astro/Starlight with a React wrapper). It indexes interoperability documentation and answers external partner developers' questions by reformulating content in clearer language with concrete examples — rather than quoting documentation verbatim.
The bot is available as a floating widget in the bottom-right corner on every portal page and as a dedicated full-page experience at a fixed portal route. Both modes require EMIS-X authentication. When the bot cannot answer from the indexed documentation, it escalates the query to the internal team via a Teams webhook notification and sends a confirmation email to the partner developer via AWS SES.
**Core Problem Solved:**
Internal developers are spending approximately 20% of sprint time answering repetitive interop capability questions from external partners. This is causing developer burnout, backlog delays, and potential partner revenue loss. The bot targets reducing this to under 5% of sprint time.
**Primary Users:**
- **External partner developers:** Primary audience — technically literate developers (junior to senior) integrating with EMIS APIs and the SMART-on-FHIR-style app launch system
- **Internal staff:** Secondary beneficiaries — freed from answering repetitive questions
