## Key Assumptions & Risks
### High-Risk Assumptions
1. **AI implementation approach** — Risk: High — Validation: Pipeline 03 Architecture decision (LLM vs RAG vs embeddings vs fine-tuned model)
2. **Documentation corpus quality** — Risk: Medium — Assumption: Existing docs are accurate enough to index; bot reformulation will improve clarity not correctness
### Key Risks
1. **AI/ML implementation** — Likelihood: High — Impact: High — Mitigation: Pipeline 03 Architecture must decide approach before build starts; timeboxed to 2 sprints
2. **GDPR lawful basis unconfirmed** — Likelihood: Medium — Impact: High — Mitigation: IG owner must confirm before go-live; currently a GO-LIVE BLOCKER
3. **Teams webhook availability** — Likelihood: Low — Impact: Medium — Mitigation: User-visible error message on webhook failure; retry policy TBD in Pipeline 03
