## Integration Points
| System | Purpose | Authentication | Data Flow | Failure Mode |
|--------|---------|---------------|-----------|--------------|
| Microsoft Teams (webhook) | Escalation notifications to internal team | Webhook URL (environment secret) | Outbound — email, chat history, page URL, timestamp | User sees "system unavailable, try later" message |
| AWS SES | Confirmation email to partner developer | AWS IAM (environment credentials) | Outbound — confirmation email | Silent failure — Teams webhook still fires |
| GitHub Actions | CI/CD pipeline for documentation indexing | Repository permissions + secrets | Triggered on portal update | Deployment blocked if indexing fails |
| EMIS-X Auth | Authentication for all chat access | EMIS-X OAuth2 | Inbound — session token validation | Redirect to EMIS-X login |
